1)) (justify left)) (uuid "5548cf6c-126a-552b-a135-689378d6a22c"))(text "TX AC coupling is on the connector side of the mux, following TI UFP reference. No duplicate SoC TX capacitors." (at 15 250.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "ff2db442-f051-5b43-9ab2-bd2af1a95682"))(text "USB_SHIELD termination and connector footprint remain to validate. Passive MPNs are not selected." (at 15 255.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "6c180615-2685-507f-a220-3873bd831869"))(text "RK3568 endpoints: T28/T27 TX+/-; R28/R27 RX+/-; P27/P28 DP/DM; M24 VBUSDET needs its own sensing circuit." (at 15 260.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "538b1403-8644-59fa-9e6d-040b1c3e4048"))(text "Sources: TI HD3SS3220 SLLSES1E, TPD4EUSB30 SLVSAC2G; Rockchip Hardware Design Guide V1.2." (at 15 265.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "42af54ca-fac9-5691-88d5-0409fd04e8dc")))
